faction_ra2_asianalliance =
   .name = Asian Alliance
   .description = Asian Alliance from Eagle Red Mod
      Asian Alliance is a massive high-tech coalition of China, Japan, and Korea.
      Acting as a unified East Asian front that has decided to pursue its own
      technological path, independent of the Allied and Soviet blocs. They focus on
      pulverizer, fire and high-energy plasma weaponry and mass infantry deployment.

      In Cameo, the Asian Alliance is a versatile high-tech faction with a deep
      promotion tree, doctrine swap system, and powerful plasma weapons. Their
      Photon Cannon technology fires bouncing plasma projectiles that deal multiple
      damage types. The Asian Phalanx doctrine creates a proximity aura that buffs
      nearby allied units. Their promotion tree unlocks unique units like Samurai,
      Veteran Archers, ASDF, War Turtle, Fanatic, MLRS, Pulverizer Mecha, and
      Heavy Railgun Tank.

      Difficulty: ©©©©
      Early Game: ©©©
      Mid Game: ©©©©
      Late Game: ©©©©©
      Playstyle: High-Tech / Mass Infantry / Promotion Tree
      Strength: Plasma Weapons, Promotion Units, Doctrines, Mass Paradrop
      Weakness: Early Game Armor, Complex Tech Tree
      Countered by: Early Aggression, Air Rushes, Artillery

      Special Units: Quasar (plasma tank with EMP upgrade), Dragonfly (hover
        transport), Lynx Tank (MBT with Phalanx aura), Kamikaze/Tsunami Carrier,
        Samurai, Veteran Archers, ASDF, War Turtle, Fanatic, Type 89 MLRS,
        Pulverizer Mecha, Heavy Railgun Tank, Asian Militia/Grenadier,
        Asian Tank Killer, Ninja, Crocodile
      Special Buildings: Advanced Communication Center (Ion Cannon),
        Chaos Storm Inductor, Naval Yard, Military Academy, Airfield
      Team Upgrades: Way of the Dragon, Asian Diplomacy
      Doctrines: Modernized Infantry Equipment, Heavy Pulverizer Weapons, Asian Phalanx
      Tech Upgrades: Dragon Fire, Celestial Power (EMP upgrade), Banzai Mode
      Support powers: Mass Paradrop, Cluster Bombs, Chaos Bombs
      Superweapons: Ion Cannon, Chaos Storm

      Features:
      - Pulverizer, fire, and high-energy plasma weaponry
      - Mass infantry deployment with Mass Paradrop support power
      - Photon Cannon: plasma projectile dealing multiple damage types (missile, flak, tesla, magic)
      - Asian Phalanx doctrine: proximity aura buffs nearby allied units
      - Celestial Power: upgrades all plasma weapons to add EMP effects
      - Banzai Mode: kamikaze ability for all infantry
      - Dragon Fire: enhances flame weapons
      - Way of the Dragon: team upgrade enhancing combat units
      - Asian Diplomacy: team upgrade providing economic/diplomatic benefits
      - Deep promotion tree with 8+ unlockable units across infantry and vehicle trees
      - Tsunami Carrier: upgraded Kamikaze Carrier with enhanced capabilities
      - Dragonfly: hover-capable open-topped transport with garrisoned fireports
      - Lynx Tank: MBT that projects Asian Phalanx aura to nearby allies
      - Naval Yard for amphibious/naval operations
      - Chaos Storm: devastating area superweapon
      - Ion Cannon: orbital laser superweapon

